sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant API as WebApi Controllers
    participant Med as MediatR
    participant H as Application Handlers
    participant Repo as Repository/UoW
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant PayOS as PayOS Service
    participant Noti as INotificationService
    participant Hub as RestaurantHub

    Note over Client,API: API Inventory (grouped)<br/>Auth: login, CreateAccount, CreateWaiter, CreateChef, RegisterCustomer<br/>Account: GetAll<br/>Area/Category/Product: CRUD + status/info update<br/>Table: CRUD + byArea + QR generate/refresh/bySession<br/>Order: list/get/create/update-info/update-status/create-online<br/>OrderItem: list/create/update-info/update-status<br/>Cashier/Bill: list/get/create/update/pay/cancel<br/>Payment: create-link/info/cancel/webhook/confirm-webhook<br/>Customer: getByAccount/update/delete<br/>WorkSchedule: list/create/update/delete/checkin/checkout<br/>Dashboard: summary

    Client->>API: HTTP request
    API->>Med: Send(Command/Query)
    Med->>H: Dispatch

    alt Unhappy - validation/auth/business/not-found
        H-->>Med: Result.Failure(message)
        Med-->>API: Failure
        API-->>Client: 400/401/403/404
    else Happy - standard CRUD/query
        H->>Repo: Read/Write aggregate
        Repo->>DB: SQL + COMMIT
        DB-->>Repo: OK
        H-->>Med: Result.Success(data)
        Med-->>API: Success
        API-->>Client: 200/201
    end

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,Hub: Realtime (Order/OrderItem status)
        H->>Noti: Notify*(targetRoles?)
        Noti->>Hub: Push to role groups (role:{name})
        Hub-->>Client: SignalR event
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 235)
        Note over Client,PayOS: Payment flow (create-link/webhook)
        H->>PayOS: CreatePaymentLink / VerifyWebhook
        alt Unhappy - provider/signature/tx/bill invalid
            H-->>API: Failure
            API-->>Client: 400/404/500
        else Happy - payment success
            H->>Repo: Update Transaction + Bill + Order + Table/QRSession
            Repo->>DB: COMMIT
            API-->>Client: 200
        end
    end
